pfSense OpenVPN Client Importer (OVP)

This package adds a web UI page to pfSense 2.8 that allows administrators to
import standard OpenVPN .ovpn configuration files directly from the browser.

Features:
  - Upload and parse .ovpn files (unified inline format)
  - Automatically extract and import CA certificates, client certificates,
    client keys, and TLS authentication keys into the pfSense Certificate Manager
  - Map all common OpenVPN directives to pfSense OpenVPN client fields
  - Support for TLS-auth, TLS-crypt, cipher, auth digest, compression, and more
  - Preview parsed configuration before applying
  - Activates the new VPN client immediately without requiring a reboot

WWW: https://github.com/SomeoneCares/pFSense-OVP
